<title>INDIA: India Reliance '96/97 net seen declining.</title>
<headline>India Reliance '96/97 net seen declining.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrochemicals giant Reliance Industries Ltd's net profit will drop 7.63 percent to 12.06 billion rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, a Reuter poll consensus showed.</p>
<p>Analysts at 28 leading securities and brokerage firms forecast post-tax profit at a low of 8.95 billion rupees to a high of 16.0 billion rupees against 13.05 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>RELIANCE  ----PAT seen down 7.63%, sales up 4.22%</p>
<p>			Net profit  1995/96     Net sales  1995/96</p>
<p>				 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average	     12,056.44  13,052.70   81,151.60  77,863.40</p>
<p>High		  16,000.00		  93,000.00</p>
<p>Low		    8,950.00		  75,000.00</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
